claim.claim-text:
a support panel (SU) including a body (BP) and a guide (GP), the guide (GP) being on one side of the body (BP);
a protective cap (CA, CA1) spaced apart from the guide (GP) at one side of the support panel (SU);
a first display substrate (PA) on the support panel (SU); and
a flexible printed circuit board (FPC) on one side of the first display substrate (PA),
wherein:
